[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 4080.23, "timestamp": "01:08:00", "text": "是的。富士山，你得亲自去看看。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4083.349, "timestamp": "01:08:03", "text": "是的。是的。我想看"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4086.47, "timestamp": "01:08:06", "text": "就像你知道的，某人的真实影像资料。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4089.829, "timestamp": "01:08:09", "text": "我认识的人都去过那里。是的，它会"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4092.99, "timestamp": "01:08:12", "text": "让我非常非常开心。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4096.63, "timestamp": "01:08:16", "text": "是的。劳拉，真为你感到高兴。我真是太"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4102.48, "timestamp": "01:08:22", "text": "是的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4105.03, "timestamp": "01:08:25", "text": "[音乐]"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4108.309, "timestamp": "01:08:28", "text": "是的。今天过得很开心。等等，有多少个？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4110.07, "timestamp": "01:08:30", "text": "还剩几分钟？呃，现在是九点。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4113.749, "timestamp": "01:08:33", "text": "正确的？是的，现在是9点。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4117.789, "timestamp": "01:08:37", "text": "所以，你吃过饭了吗？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4122.63, "timestamp": "01:08:42", "text": "嗯，我吃了点东西。是的。好，好"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4128.55, "timestamp": "01:08:48", "text": "好的。你吃了没？我吃了你"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4131.669, "timestamp": "01:08:51", "text": "可以说那是夜宵，但我不能这么说"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4134.309, "timestamp": "01:08:54", "text": "感觉想吃午饭，而不是午晚餐。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4137.99, "timestamp": "01:08:57", "text": "我总是搞砸这件事。呃"}]